  time. Size is an editorial estimate.\nScope: Understanding adaptive beha
 vior through biological and artificial agents\, including embodied cognit
 ion\, neural and computational models\, robotics\, learning\, evolution a
 nd collective behavior. The biennial ISAB meeting combines archival proce
 edings papers with deliberately non-archival contributions and poster abs
 tracts.\nAdditional topics: Machine Learning\, Reinforcement Learning\, A
 utonomous Agents & Multiagent Systems\nScope sources (2026): https://sab-
 conference.org/call-for-contributions/\nScope last checked: 2026-10-08
